Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.67,0:01:03.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Talk about close!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.04,0:01:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Glad I dug that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.71,0:01:15.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,At this very moment,\NI'm working my way through another world alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:27.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,590.4)}{\an7}Loner With the Worst Skills
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.71,0:01:27.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's take things back to the day I got transported.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.33,0:01:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was spending lunch reading like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.46,0:01:35.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,All alone, as you can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.71,0:01:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,As anyone can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.71,0:01:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup. I lived a loner life in the real world, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Quit rubbing it in! You're not wrong, but still!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.83,0:01:50.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So why was I alone? That's easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Because I wanted nothing to do with my classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:55.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'd get in the way of my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.42,0:01:59.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I had to divide up the class, it'd be...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.92,0:02:00.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,...the delinquents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.33,0:02:03.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The valley gal sort.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The jocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The nerds.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.67,0:02:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The class reps.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.67,0:02:16.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then there's just... the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.50,0:02:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,And me, not part of any group.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:24.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wha-?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.04,0:02:32.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.29,0:02:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,A magic circle?! Just like the one\Nin the light novel I was reading?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I got excited for a quick second,\Nbefore realizing an isekai would be a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll stick to the sort in my books.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.25,0:02:55.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dunno who's doing this, but no thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.29,0:03:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,It was like my body had a mind of its own,\Ntrying desperately to leave the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it REALLY tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:07.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I figured. That's how these things go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.75,0:03:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.25,0:03:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,My body's disappearing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No freakin' way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.83,0:03:14.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whadda we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.63,0:03:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's goin' on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:17.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gimme a freaking break!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.38,0:03:16.17,Q2,,0,0,0,,Are we...?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.33,0:03:21.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only one way out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.71,0:03:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,My last hope was up into the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.88,0:03:37.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Phew, doubt it'll reach me up here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.50,0:03:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.04,0:03:49.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh, I'm in for it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.38,0:03:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ol' nothing-but-white room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.13,0:03:54.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So uhh, why is no one else here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:04:01.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Isn't there usually some fatso king or a beautiful princess\Nno geek would ever meet in real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.17,0:04:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm? That old guy's all alone like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The old dude was in a panic.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.17,0:04:10.50,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,57.6)}{\an7}Why are you here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:11.63,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(512,439.2)}{\an7}Everyone's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Turns out he's some god in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.92,0:04:13.33,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,57.6)}{\an7}Hurry and get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.04,0:04:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the rest of the class\Nwas out in the new world already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.08,0:04:19.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I was the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.21,0:04:21.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Guess even the omniscient\Noverlooked my little escape route!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.54,0:04:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,He urged me to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.29,0:04:24.96,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,57.6)}{\an7}It's first-come first-served!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And so I had to set my isekai stats and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.21,0:04:27.83,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,424.8)}{\an7}Got to set your stats!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:45.58,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,64.8)}{\an7}WEAPON ARTS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:45.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,194.4)}{\an7}IAIDO SWORDSMANSHIP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:45.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,266.4)}{\an7}DUAL BLADES
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:45.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1011.2,345.6)}{\an7}GREATSWORDS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:45.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,396)}{\an7}SHIELDS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.25,0:04:45.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,446.4)}{\an7}COMET STRIKE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.26,0:04:45.58,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.4,518.4)}{\an7}DAGGERS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.33,0:04:43.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Normally, each person gets 50 points to use
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,on skills and magic and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.25,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,64.8)}{\an7}WEAPON ARTS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,194.4)}{\an7}IAIDO SWORDSMANSHIP
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.58,0:04:46.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,266.4)}{\an7}DUAL BLADES
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1011.2,345.6)}{\an7}GREATSWORDS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,396)}{\an7}SHIELDS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(576,446.4)}{\an7}COMET STRIKE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.25,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.4,518.4)}{\an7}DAGGERS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.42,0:04:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,But this was the old man's first time\Nroping in 43 people at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,172.8)}{\an7}SHIELD APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,223.2)}{\an7}COMBAT APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,273.6)}{\an7}BOW APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.75,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,324)}{\an7}MAGIC APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.75,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,374.4)}{\an7}DUMMY
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:54.75,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,424.8)}{\an7}COMPANY COMMUNICATOR
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:54.75,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,504)}{\an7}MASTER OF NONE
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.46,0:04:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the OP skills were first-come first-served,\Nand the rest were all crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.50,0:04:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still, I figured I'd better take a good look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:06.13,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1075.2,64.8)}{\an7}POINT
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:06.13,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036.8,115.2)}{\an7}ALLOCATION
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:06.13,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1049.6,165.6)}{\an7}FOR STATS
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:06.13,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(384,230.4)}{\an7}YOU MAY ALLOCATE 1 POINT TO EACH STAT
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.25,0:05:06.13,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(435.2,331.2)}{\an7}OR ROLL DICE (10P FOR 2 DICE)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.38,0:05:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Definitely not going for dice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.33,0:05:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even if I got two sixes, that'd only put me at 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.75,0:05:06.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What kind of moron would go for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q12,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1036.8,115.2)}{\an7}EQUIPMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1075.2,165.6)}{\an7}ITEMS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,57.6)}{\an7}PALADIN SET                                     GREAT SAGE SET
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,151.2)}{\an7}VILLAGER A SET
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,208.8)}{\an7}ALCHEMIST SET
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(243.2,345.6)}{\an7}CONTACT LENSES
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742.4,396)}{\an7}BLACK KNIGHT SET
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(230.4,496.8)}{\an7}RING                                   BERSERKER SET
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.13,0:05:15.42,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.2,547.2)}{\an7}ANTIDOTE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:09.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,All that's left is a "Villager A Set" and "Contact Lenses"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.13,0:05:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who the heck is Villager A? Talk about lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.17,0:05:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be a Paladin or a Great Sage or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:24.67,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,57.6)}{\an7}MARTIAL ARTS
