Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Staves"? A staff is basically just a stick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.50,0:05:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you just hit things with sticks?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do you survive an isekai like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.50,0:05:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gimme a sword or a spear or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q14,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1113.6,50.4)}{\an7}SKILL
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,100.8)}{\an7}EXP BOOST
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,288)}{\an7}PILLAGE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,417.6)}{\an7}HEIGHTENED INTUITION          SWORDSMANSHIP
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870.4,57.6)}{\an7}CLAIRVOYANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q16,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,266.4)}{\an7}WELL-BEING                        WALKING
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q16,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,403.2)}{\an7}CALISTHENICS             SENSITIVITY
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.67,0:05:33.29,Q15,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,237.6)}{\an7}SORCERY
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:27.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are "Well-being" and "Walking" even skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is there nothing else?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.08,0:05:32.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanted something OP like Pillaging or Clairvoyance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:42.29,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100.8,50.4)}{\an7}MAGIC
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:42.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,100.8)}{\an7}GRAND MAGIC                    FLAME         LIGHTNING            FIRE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:42.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,201.6)}{\an7}HEALING
