Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:42.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,511.2)}{\an7}ELEMENTAL BOOST                    DEATH                       CHARM
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:42.29,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(422.4,201.6)}{\an7}TEMPERATURE             PACKING
