Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.30,0:05:42.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,223.2)}{\an7}DARK
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.54,0:05:36.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course the go-to Grand Magic is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.83,0:05:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,No idea what the stuff left even does.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,How can there even be crap magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:50.29,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1088,36)}{\an7}SPECIAL
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:50.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,86.4)}{\an7}SHIELD APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:50.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,136.8)}{\an7}COMBAT APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.29,0:05:50.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,194.4)}{\an7}MAGIC APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:50.29,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,244.8)}{\an7}BOW APTITUDE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:50.29,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,302.4)}{\an7}COMPANY COMMUNICATOR
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:50.29,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,374.4)}{\an7}MASTER OF NONE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.30,0:05:50.29,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,424.8)}{\an7}DUMMY
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.46,0:05:44.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What does "Company Communicator" even do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.38,0:05:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Am I supposed to be an office worker, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.83,0:05:50.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And how can "Dummy" be anything but bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:56.92,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1113.6,50.4)}{\an7}TITLE
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:56.92,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(345.6,100.8)}{\an7}SAINT                                       FIEND SLAYER
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:56.92,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,165.6)}{\an7} NEET
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.29,0:05:56.92,Q13,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,216)}{\an7}SHUT-IN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.30,0:05:56.92,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,482.4)}{\an7}ILLUSIONIST                         TACTICIAN                               GUARDIAN
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:53.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now shut-ins and NEETs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,How are slackers gonna take down monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.88,Q17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,180)}{\an7}HEALTH
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.88,Q17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,230.4)}{\an7}WALKING
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.88,Q17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,280.8)}{\an7}CALISTHENICS
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:06:00.88,Q17,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,331.2)}{\an7}SENSITIVITY
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.00,0:05:59.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait. That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.96,0:06:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's crap, and then there's this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,WHAT'S THE DEAL, OLD MAN?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.29,0:06:09.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Skills like these won't even get me through the first town!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.17,0:06:11.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You gotta have better skills to choose from!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can you not even estimate\Nhow many people you're summoning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.25,0:06:18.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,And you call yourself a god?\NAre you outta your mind? Seriously, are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.25,0:06:20.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,By then, the old man was sick of my complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:27.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Fine, take all the skills left! Now begone!" he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.38,Q18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627.2,172.8)}{\an7}TEMPERATURE   PACKING
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.38,Q18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.6,223.2)}{\an7}WEIGHT   MOVEMENT
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.38,Q18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.2,273.6)}{\an7}COMPANY COMMUNICATOR
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.38,Q18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,338.4)}{\an7}DUMMY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.38,Q18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,396)}{\an7}WELL-BEING   WALKING
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.05,0:06:35.38,Q18,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,475.2)}{\an7}CALISTHENICS SENSITIVITY
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.88,0:06:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I wound up with all the leftover crap,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,and was basically guaranteed nightmare mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,He seriously teleported me...\NHow am I supposed to handle an isekai outta nowhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.33,0:06:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wasn't ready for this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:58.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then again, I guess no one ever is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:06:59.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.58,0:07:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess this must be...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.13,0:07:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,...the Villager A Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, can this thing hold infinite items?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.58,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,57.6)}{\an7}Contacts                                                  Cloak                                          Leather Boots
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.58,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,316.8)}{\an7}Wooden Stick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.83,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,57.6)}{\an7}Wooden Stick
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.58,0:07:11.83,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,432)}{\an7}Ring of the Dead Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.04,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,180)}{\an7}Ring of the Dead Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.04,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729.6,547.2)}{\an7}Jewel of Knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.00,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729.6,280.8)}{\an7}Jewel of Knowledge
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:14.00,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,518.4)}{\an7}Villager A's Diary
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still looks like a bunch of leftover crap, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not half bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,So! Now that I look good, how are my stats?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemme just open "Check Stats," and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:32.75,Q20,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,439.2)}{\an7}Please roll the dice
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.71,0:07:32.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What? Why dice?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.33,Q21,,0,0,0,,{\pos(409.6,223.2)}{\an7}YOU MAY ALLOCATE 1 POINT TO EACH STAT
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:34.33,Q21,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,331.2)}{\an7}OR ROLL DICE (10P FOR 2 DICE)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.42,0:07:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That old fart really stuck me with EVERYTHING!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Was he cleaning out stock or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the heck?! What does "M" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:48.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please tell me it's not M for minus!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.54,0:07:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or maybe M for masochism?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.96,0:07:53.21,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,187.2)}{\an7}Certainly not that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.96,0:07:53.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice retort!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.21,0:07:54.71,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,194.4)}{\an7}Which stat do you wish to allocate to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.50,0:07:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like I'm gonna pull through\Nwith any other strengths, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:01.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Put it on Luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.38,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,172.8)}{\an7}Points allocated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.38,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,295.2)}{\an7}Which stat do you wish
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.00,0:08:02.38,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,403.2)}{\an7}to allocate to next?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget worrying about balance! Time to go all in!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.63,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,295.2)}{\an7}Points allocated to Luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.63,Q22,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,410.4)}{\an7}Now calculating stats
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.25,Q23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,158.4)}{\an7}SPECIES:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.25,Q23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(332.8,208.8)}{\an7}HUMAN
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.25,Q23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(256,504)}{\an7}MARTIAL ARTS:    CANE TECHNIQUE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.25,Q23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(256,554.4)}{\an7}MAGIC:          TEMPERATURE         MOVE                 WEIGHT           PACKING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.25,0:08:17.25,Q23,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,604.8)}{\an7}SKILLS:              HEALTH           SENSITIVITY       CALISTHENICS     WALKING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.67,0:08:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,My Luck skill is off the charts. So M stood for Max?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:23.88,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,57.6)}{\an7}RACE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.25,0:08:23.88,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,180)}{\an7}HUMAN
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.63,0:08:25.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,The rest is still all crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:29.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,122.4)}{\an7}MARTIAL ARTS:     CANE TECHNIQUE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:29.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,216)}{\an7}MAGIC:        TEMPERATURE      MOVE              WEIGHT           PACKING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:29.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,302.4)}{\an7}SKILLS:        HEALTH             SENSITIVITY        CALISTHENICS      WALKING
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:29.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,396)}{\an7}TITLE:                 SHUT-IN                       NEET                 LONER
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:29.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,475.2)}{\an7}COMPANY COMMUNICATOR   MASTER OF NONE        DUMMY
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.88,0:08:29.25,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,554.4)}{\an7}EQUIPMENT: CLOTH BAG
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.67,0:08:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, there are two extra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.25,Q24,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,57.6)}{\an7}Subjugate                                                                 Loner
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.25,Q25,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,136.8)}{\an7}SUBJUGATE OTHERS TO FOLLOW YOUR COMMAND                                                            MUST SURVIVE ALONE.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.25,Q25,,0,0,0,,{\pos(857.6,187.2)}{\an7}CANNOT FORM PARTY.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.25,Q26,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,259.2)}{\an7}Additional Ability
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.25,Q25,,0,0,0,,{\pos(716.8,352.8)}{\an7}IF YOU WANT
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:35.25,Q25,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,403.2)}{\an7}TO MAKE FRIENDS
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that because I got pulled in alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.50,0:08:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Apparently, when you're a loner\Nyou can use the subjugate skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.33,0:08:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stuck alone in another world, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.25,0:08:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,There go my chances of an isekai harem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why's no one else around, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.79,0:08:45.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone shoulda been sucked in here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah, who cares? Can't form a party anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.63,0:08:55.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only thing I gotta worry about now\Nis setting up somewhere safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.83,0:08:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then I just need to find some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:09:01.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to make myself a home!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.33,0:09:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hard to see anything stuck in these woods, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.46,0:09:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,If a monster rolled up on me now, I'd be done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.92,0:09:20.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dunno if my well-honed fake sleeping ability\Nwould do me any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.42,0:09:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! I still haven't tried those contacts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.04,0:09:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.08,0:09:33.58,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1113.6,158.4)}{\an7}Nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.96,0:09:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,These don't just let me see things!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.08,0:09:33.58,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,496.8)}{\an7}Phsyical Strength Mushroom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.58,0:09:33.58,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.6,360)}{\an7}Nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:34.83,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,273.6)}{\an7}Medicinal Herbs
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.58,0:09:34.83,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(691.2,367.2)}{\an7}Nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:34.83,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,446.4)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They let me see EVERYTHING!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.21,0:09:37.83,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(140.8,194.4)}{\an7}Antidote
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.58,0:09:37.83,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,144)}{\an7}Potion
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Clear as day!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.92,0:09:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,How do these even work?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.92,0:09:43.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,These contacts give me the Appraisal skill?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.88,0:09:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,This brings a lot into focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.83,Q28,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,57.6)}{\an7}CONTACTS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.08,0:09:46.83,Q28,,0,0,0,,{\pos(294.4,237.6)}{\an7}APPRAISAL: ABILITY TO JUDGE ALL VISIBLE THINGS
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:46.83,Q29,,0,0,0,,{\pos(652.8,453.6)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:46.83,Q30,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,504)}{\an7}Edible. Boosts potential capacities.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,My Appraisal skill opened up a whole new world.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:57.63,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,388.8)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.67,0:09:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And made things more fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.17,Q31,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:00.46,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627.2,36)}{\an7}Bird
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:00.46,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1126.4,86.4)}{\an7}Nuts
