Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.63,0:10:00.46,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(396.8,439.2)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.2,28.8)}{\an7}Bird
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,79.2)}{\an7}Antidote Herb
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,129.6)}{\an7}Medicinal Herb
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,180)}{\an7}Bird
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(883.2,230.4)}{\an7}Nuts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.4,403.2)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(729.6,468)}{\an7}Medicinal Herb
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:04.25,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(256,518.4)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:05.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, look at these!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:10.46,Q33,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,57.6)}{\an7}Potenshroom
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:10.46,Q34,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,201.6)}{\an7}EDIBLE.     BOOSTS POTENTIAL CAPACITIES.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:10.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Edible mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,My bag could hold everything I found,\Nand I had potions packed in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I really should apologize\Nfor talking down the Villager A Set.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.25,0:10:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can find anything out here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.96,0:10:23.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.67,0:10:48.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Delish!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.29,0:10:49.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.42,0:11:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,A cave?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.50,0:11:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Anyone home?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:15.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry for intruding if this is your home, monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really hope it's not, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice and spacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1062.4,7.2)}{\an7}Magic Tent
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(755.2,57.6)}{\an7}CAN BE DEPLOYED OR PACKED UP USING MAGIC.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,108)}{\an7}REMAINS ROOM TEMPERATURE.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,158.4)}{\an7}WARDS OFF BUGS AND MONSTERS
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q32,,0,0,0,,{\pos(832,388.8)}{\an7}Magic Lantern
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(793.6,439.2)}{\an7}CAN BE LIT, SET TO FLASH,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,489.6)}{\an7}OR EXTINGUISHED USING MAGIC.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.67,0:11:41.17,Q35,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.4,540)}{\an7}WARDS OFF BUGS AND MONSTERS.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got a tent and a lamp in my bag, already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.58,0:11:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Already feelin' like settling in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.29,0:11:44.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gathered up some wood and leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:46.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now to just use my Temperature magic and...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.92,0:11:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That should keep the beasts away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,This leftover magic isn't so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:12:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lemme just check my stats before I pass out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.58,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,64.8)}{\an7}MAGIC
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.58,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,115.2)}{\an7}Temperature   Movement   Weight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.09,0:12:04.58,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,165.6)}{\an7}Packing        Fire Magic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.46,0:12:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice, my Temperature skill leveled up\Nand I got "Fire Magic".
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,7.2)}{\an7}MAGIC
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.58,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,57.6)}{\an7}Temperature   Movement   Weight
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,108)}{\an7}Packing        Fire Magic
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(947.2,158.4)}{\an7}SKILLS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(780.8,208.8)}{\an7}Well-Being      Sensitivity       Calisthenics
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,259.2)}{\an7}Walking           Subjugation         Appraisal
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.59,0:12:08.96,Q19,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742.4,309.6)}{\an7}Clairvoyance    Perception    Enemy Detection
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:08.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got Clairvoyance, Perception,\Nand "Enemy Detection", too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did make sure there were no baddies around...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.13,0:12:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what if they show up...?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.83,0:12:23.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,All I can do is hit them with a stick...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.58,0:12:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And just like that I finished my first day\Nas a loner in another world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:37.08,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,115.2)}{\an7}DAY 2
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:39.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew, made it through the night no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.33,0:12:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,My items got a bonus monster repellent effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.92,0:12:46.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,All thanks to that "Shut-in" title I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice going, shut-ins!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.17,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,72)}{\an7}SHUT-IN:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.17,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,158.4)}{\an7}SHUT SELF IN
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.42,0:12:48.17,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,216)}{\an7}PROTECTS LIVING SPACE.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.29,0:12:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,My stomach's not fairing so well, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to light a fire with my new magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.67,0:13:05.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,And mix the mushrooms I gathered\Nwith the cured meat in my bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.04,0:13:09.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Add a little flavor, aaand...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:14.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Breakfast is served!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Delish! Gotta hand it to myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.00,0:13:29.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Didn't expect to have a pan and a knife.\NThe Villager A Set is doing wonders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.79,0:13:33.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did this A guy really live in a village, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's more like some wilderness survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.04,0:13:41.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget that, though.\NGotta figure out where I go from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That cave should work as a home for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:52.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next up is finding food and working on security.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:55.58,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,144)}{\an7}Stamina Caps
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.58,0:13:59.04,Q27,,0,0,0,,{\pos(742.4,554.4)}{\an7}Medicinal Herb
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.33,0:14:01.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,The real problem will be monsters...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:04.54,Q36,,0,0,0,,{\pos(819.2,100.8)}{\an7}PERCEPTION
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.63,0:14:14.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The time's come, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:17.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not one, but two goblins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:23.33,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,93.6)}{\an7}GOBLIN B
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:23.33,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1011.2,374.4)}{\an7}GOBLIN A
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.50,0:14:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,They should be pushover mobs,\Nbut those are some high stats!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.75,0:14:24.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can I win this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.88,0:14:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, out here I'm gonna have to fight eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.00,0:14:31.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,This could be my chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.46,0:14:33.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not so sure about this stick, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.42,0:14:37.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can try using "Packing"\Nto pack it full of magical energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:39.04,Q37,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,57.6)}{\an7}PACKING
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:39.04,Q38,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,158.4)}{\an7}To pack various things with magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:39.04,Q38,,0,0,0,,{\pos(115.2,216)}{\an7}It can have a wide range of effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:42.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sweet. Worked better than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.58,0:14:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forget OP skills, I can make myself OP!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, one more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's attacks are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.67,0:15:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Easy enough to read!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I survived my first battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.00,0:15:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,It wasn't perfect, but I did good.\NPassed with flying colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:56.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Took more mental damage than physical out there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.96,Q29,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1024,396)}{\an7}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.67,0:16:07.96,Q39,,0,0,0,,{\pos(896,446.4)}{\an7}A CLUB MADE OUT OF WOOD
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.08,0:16:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I brought back one of the goblin clubs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:11.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That it? This thing's short, heavy, and useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.50,0:16:13.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,My stick's good enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.21,0:16:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right, let's see, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:20.29,Q40,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,295.2)}{\an7}RACE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.29,0:16:20.29,Q40,,0,0,0,,{\pos(256,352.8)}{\an7}HUMAN
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice! I leveled up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.58,0:16:23.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa! And my stats basically doubled!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.88,0:16:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,My Staves skill went up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just from smashing things with my stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,115.2)}{\an7}MARTIAL ARTS:   STAVES              EVASION        ENEMY DETECTION     MAGIC WRAP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,194.4)}{\an7}MAGIC:     TEMPERATURE      MOVEMENT         WEIGHT         PACKING       FIRE MAGIC
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(204.8,288)}{\an7}SKILLS:           WELL-BEING    SENSITIVITY     CALISTHENICS    WALKING      SUBJUGATE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(217.6,367.2)}{\an7}TITLE:                 SHUT-IN                     NEET                   LONER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(281.6,453.6)}{\an7}COMPANY COMMUNICATOR    MASTER OF NONE     DUMMY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(256,540)}{\an7}WOODEN STICK  PLAIN CLOTHES   LEATHER GLOVES   LEATHER BOOTS   CAPE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:30.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? My Sensitivity skill, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't even need to get captured by goblins\Nand tormented like some poor lady knight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,115.2)}{\an7}MARTIAL ARTS:   STAVES              EVASION        ENEMY DETECTION     MAGIC WRAP
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,194.4)}{\an7}MAGIC:        TEMPERATURE        MOVEMENT         WEIGHT               PACKING           FIRE MAGIC
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,288)}{\an7}SKILLS:              WELL-BEING       SENSITIVITY        CALISTHENICS    WALKING         SUBJUGATE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(179.2,367.2)}{\an7}TITLE:                    SHUT-IN                        NEET                     LONER
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,453.6)}{\an7}COMPANY COMMUNICATOR    MASTER OF NONE     DUMMY
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.46,0:16:39.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,540)}{\an7}WOODEN STICK  PLAIN CLOTHES   LEATHER GLOVES   LEATHER BOOTS   CAPE
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.83,0:16:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Got something called "Magic Wrap," too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe from packing magic into my stick?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Leveled up Calisthenics, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.92,0:16:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Must be cause I always do my morning stretches!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.38,0:16:46.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Err, as of today, at least...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.46,0:16:51.46,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1100.8,144)}{\an7}DAY 3
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am so done with mushrooms...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.92,0:16:58.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I could really go for some meat, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.17,0:17:02.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bet the Class Rep wouldn't approve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.96,Q41,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1062.4,223.2)}{\an7}SAY NO
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:03.96,Q41,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,396)}{\an7}TO INDULGENCE!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,'Kay! First things first, I gotta toughen myself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.29,0:17:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,My new Magic Wrap ability
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:21.25,Q42,,0,0,0,,{\pos(358.4,79.2)}{\an7}MAGIC WRAP LV 1:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.58,0:17:21.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,can boost my physical abilities plus my physical and\Nmagic defense, putting most other skill sets to shame!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:25.00,Q43,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,93.6)}{\an7}Magic Wrap
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.25,0:17:25.00,Q43,,0,0,0,,{\pos(601.6,194.4)}{\an7}Corner
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.58,0:17:24.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The isekai housewives would line up\Nfor a bargain like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, my Appraisal skill leveled up, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.00,0:17:33.79,Q40,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,100.8)}{\an7}LEATHER GLOVES ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.50,0:17:33.79,Q40,,0,0,0,,{\pos(102.4,547.2)}{\an7}CAPE ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.25,0:17:33.79,Q40,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,50.4)}{\an7}WOODEN STICK ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,So what's with all these question marks?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.96,0:17:36.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems worse to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:42.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whatever. Forget about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.63,0:17:45.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go out and have some fun! Yessiree!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.13,0:17:47.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time to practice magic now, one-two-three!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.83,0:17:54.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right! Nature's bounty is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:17:59.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh! No more mushrooms!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.96,0:18:02.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where does all the meat grow, huh? Where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.67,0:18:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, forget the mushrooms, it's magic time!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:11.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,What am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Magic Wrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feels like that worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.67,0:18:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Light as a feather!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:38.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,So fast it's like warping!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.71,0:18:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa! And my attacks are faster than ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.17,0:18:49.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now for some tougher goblins!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:49.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,57.6)}{\an7}GOBLIN C
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.96,0:18:49.96,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(268.8,475.2)}{\an7}GOBLIN D
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.92,0:18:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Piece of cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.75,0:18:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,So long as there's only two, they don't stand a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm already doing way better than yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.92,0:19:05.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bet I could even handle three!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.92,0:19:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll let them off this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.33,0:19:19.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotta head home and practice my magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,381.6)}{\an7}Fight
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,432)}{\an7}Items
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(550.4,482.4)}{\an7}Magic
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.2,532.8)}{\an7}Run
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(844.8,532.8)}{\an7}Haruka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,475.2)}{\an7}Goblin A
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.13,0:19:26.13,Q44,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,525.6)}{\an7}Goblin B
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.38,0:19:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,From there on it was goblin hunting by day,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.17,0:19:27.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,and magic research by night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:31.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Or maybe more like DIY time? Just lots of trial and error.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Until day five.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:38.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I beat a goblin in one hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.17,0:19:41.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Decorated my base a bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.71,0:19:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Feels like I've got the hang of this isekai thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:49.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now to just keep it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,YES! Meat at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.92,0:19:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.54,0:20:01.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,A little meaty-treat, at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.96,0:20:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.83,0:20:14.67,Q36,,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,388.8)}{\an7}PERCEPTION
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.92,0:20:14.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was no goblin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.75,0:20:21.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are those...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:23.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Of course it has to be the class delinquents...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:33.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything to do with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.00,0:20:37.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.33,0:20:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,There might be someone over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.79,0:20:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Clairvoyance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.63,0:20:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next it's the gal gang? You gotta be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.67,0:20:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,And over there are the jocks?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.67,0:20:57.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Definitely don't wanna bump into them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.29,0:21:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even the nerds? I mean,\Nwe used to talk sometimes, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.08,0:21:03.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,no thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:11.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The class rep...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.42,0:21:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This world is a vicious place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.96,0:21:22.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know it's better to have companions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've known the class rep\Nsince our first day at elementary school, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.71,0:21:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.04,0:21:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.71,0:21:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,All this freedom and isolation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.54,0:21:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one to tell me what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.67,0:21:50.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing can beat a life like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it! Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.58,0:21:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.83,0:21:56.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.25,0:22:03.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,...gonna master this world alone!
